---
import SectionHeader from './SectionHeader.astro';
---

<section class="py-20 sm:py-28 bg-[#080b11] relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative">
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
      
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 flex flex-col gap-6">
        <SectionHeader
          eyebrow="Open Source & Architecture"
          title="Engineering Without Compromise"
          subtitle="Software engineered with respect for user autonomy, device efficiency, and long-term maintainability. Built on Arch Linux, zero telemetry, no dark patterns, and transparent architecture."
        />

        <div class="space-y-3 text-zinc-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed font-normal">
          <p>
            Build the useful thing first. Run it on real hardware. Find what breaks. Fix the smallest real cause, and keep working on it until it feels right.
          </p>
          <p class="text-zinc-400 text-xs sm:text-sm">
            Every layer in the system is designed to run locally by default: from the custom AndroidX Media3 decode buffers that mitigate OEM background kills, to on-device Room SQLite caching that ensures your listening data never leaves your device.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-1">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono bg-sky-500/10 border border-sky-500/25 text-[#38bdf8]">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#38bdf8]"></span>
            <span>Arch Linux</span>
          </span>
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono bg-indigo-500/10 border border-indigo-500/25 text-[#818cf8]">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#818cf8]"></span>
            <span>Zero Telemetry</span>
          </span>
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/25 text-[#34d399]">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#34d399]"></span>
            <span>Local-First SQLite</span>
          </span>
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono bg-rose-500/10 border border-rose-500/25 text-[#f43f5e]">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#f43f5e]"></span>
            <span>GNU GPL v3</span>
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-3 border-t border-white/[0.08] flex items-center justify-between text-sm">
          <div>
            <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-zinc-500 uppercase block mb-0.5">Global Localization</span>
            <span class="text-white text-sm font-medium">Translated into 36 languages on Weblate</span>
          </div>
          <a 
            href="https://hosted.weblate.org/engage/levyra/" 
            target="_blank" 
            rel="noopener noreferrer" 
            class="text-xs font-mono text-[#38bdf8] hover:text-[#818cf8] font-medium transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1.5"
          >
            <span>Contribute</span>
            <span>→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-6 flex items-center justify-center">
        <div class="relative w-full max-w-md flex items-center justify-center">
          <div class="absolute -inset-10 bg-gradient-to-tr from-[#38bdf8]/25 via-[#818cf8]/20 to-[#f43f5e]/15 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-80 pointer-events-none"></div>
          <img 
            src="/assets/brand/arch-linux-logo.svg" 
            alt="Official Arch Linux Logo" 
            class="relative z-10 w-full max-w-[320px] sm:max-w-[360px] h-auto object-contain drop-shadow-[0_25px_50px_rgba(23,147,209,0.35)] hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500 ease-out"
            loading="lazy"
            width="360"
            height="360"
          />
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
